@PcBuilder.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5129

### All active parts, sorted by name
GET {{PcBuilder.Api_HostAddress}}/api/parts
Accept: application/json

### GPUs, most expensive first
GET {{PcBuilder.Api_HostAddress}}/api/parts?category=Gpu&sort=PriceDesc
Accept: application/json

### Search in name and brand
GET {{PcBuilder.Api_HostAddress}}/api/parts?search=ryzen&sort=PriceAsc
Accept: application/json

### Invalid category -> 400 ValidationProblemDetails
GET {{PcBuilder.Api_HostAddress}}/api/parts?category=Monitor
Accept: application/json

### Part details (specs shape depends on category)
GET {{PcBuilder.Api_HostAddress}}/api/parts/1
Accept: application/json

### Unknown id -> 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{PcBuilder.Api_HostAddress}}/api/parts/99999
Accept: application/json

### Compatibility check: valid build (ids from the current seed order)
# 9700X, B650 Tomahawk, 32 GB DDR5, RTX 4070 Super, RM750e, 4000D, 990 Pro -> only R13 info
POST {{PcBuilder.Api_HostAddress}}/api/compatibility/check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "partId": 19 }, { "partId": 45 }, { "partId": 76 }, { "partId": 30 },
    { "partId": 60 }, { "partId": 1 }, { "partId": 83 }
  ]
}

### Compatibility check: AM4 CPU on AM5 board, ATX board in Mini-ITX case -> R01, R05 errors
POST {{PcBuilder.Api_HostAddress}}/api/compatibility/check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [{ "partId": 13 }, { "partId": 45 }, { "partId": 12 }]
}

### Compatibility check: two RAM kits (quantity counts toward price, slots and capacity)
POST {{PcBuilder.Api_HostAddress}}/api/compatibility/check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [{ "partId": 45 }, { "partId": 76, "quantity": 2 }]
}

### OpenAPI document
GET {{PcBuilder.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
